MODULE: RepairCrashDropsCapture
TARGET: CaptureFrozen
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: reactivation forgets the durable captured payload while retaining its first-capture witness
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
Crash ==
    /\ Live /\ faults < MaxFaults
    /\ faults' = faults + 1
    /\ reported' = [reported EXCEPT !["original"] = applied, !["repair"] = repairApplied]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<Coordinator,source,bound,rows,stage,Snapshots,retired,ordinarySeen>>
--- REPLACE
Crash ==
    /\ Live /\ faults < MaxFaults
    /\ faults' = faults + 1
    /\ reported' = [reported EXCEPT !["original"] = applied, !["repair"] = repairApplied]
    /\ captured' = Zero
    /\ UNCHANGED <<legacy,registered,decided,applied,degraded,target,first,firstTarget,
                   repairDecided,repairApplied,acknowledged,cleared,source,bound,
                   rows,stage,Snapshots,retired,ordinarySeen>>
--- END
